        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('clean data').item.json.Name }},</p>  <p>Thank you for booking your <b>free 1:1 Mains answer review</b>.</p>  <p><b>What happens next:</b></p> <ol>   <li>A mentor will WhatsApp you on <b>{{ $('clean data').item.json.Phone }}</b> within 1 hour to fix your review slot.</li>   <li>Keep one Mains answer ready (a photo or scan is fine).</li>   <li>In a 10-minute call, the mentor will show you exactly where you lost marks and how to fix it.</li> </ol>  <p>Course you chose: <b>{{ $('clean data').item.json.Course }}</b></p>  <p>See you soon,<br>The Mentor Team</p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
