        "message": "=<p><b>New free-review booking</b></p> <ul>   <li>Name: <b>{{ $('clean data').item.json.Name }}</b></li>   <li>Phone: <b>{{ $('clean data').item.json.Phone }}</b></li>   <li>Email: {{ $('clean data').item.json.Email }}</li>   <li>Course: {{ $('clean data').item.json.Course }}</li>   <li>Source: {{ $('clean data').item.json.Source }}</li> </ul> <p><a href=\"https://wa.me/91{{ $('clean data').item.json.Phone }}?text={{ encodeURIComponent('Hi ' + $('clean data').item.json.Name + ', this is [Mentor name] from [Institute]. Thank you for booking a free Mains answer review! When are you free this week for a 10-minute call?') }}\"><b>💬 Reply on WhatsApp now</b></a></p> <p>Please reply within 1 hour, then update the status in the Leads sheet.</p>\nData check: {{ $('clean data').first().json.data_quality }}",
